  ('exam', 2014, 'Língua Inglesa', NULL, 'Q32 Item 2 (TPS 2014): Based on the information conveyed by the two book reviews, judge the items right (C) or wrong (E). | Though based on real facts, both books belong to the fiction genre.', '{"a":"Certo","b":"Errado"}'::jsonb, 'b', NULL),
